{
  "_comment": "Infrastructure lifecycle registry (ADR-0077). Maps each /infrastructure component to its endoflife.date product slug, how its RUNNING version is detected, and a release-notes URL template ({version} = recommended target). eolProduct=null is an honest GAP (no public lifecycle feed). versionSource: 'gitops' = the generator greps imageGrep from the GitOps tree at build; 'probe' = the BFF reads it live at runtime (see lifecycle route); 'unknown' = not detectable in v1. NEVER hand-type a version here.",
